1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,870
- Are you just getting home?
- Yeah.

2
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:04,680
(Sheldon:)That's a good sign, right?

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,810
(Penny:)Oh, yeah.

4
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:08,480
(Sheldon:)I'm so proud of you!

5
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,650
(Sheldon:)You sold yourself out

6
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:11,820
(Sheldon:)like a common streetwalker!

7
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:15,690
(Leonard:)No, I didn't do it
for the money.

8
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:17,720
(Sheldon:)She stiffed you?

9
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:20,590
(Penny:)I believe that's what
your roommate did to her.

10
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:22,560
What?!

11
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,230
(Penny:)Again, read the
book we gave you.

12
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:26,960
(Leonard:)No, I mean,

13
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,900
I-I got the money first.

14
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,330
(Sheldon:)Smart. Get paid up front.

15
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:33,670
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I think you have a real
knack for gigolo work, Leonard.

16
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:35,340
(Leonard:)Uh...

17
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,210
(Leonard:)I'm gonna go lie down.

18
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:39,410
That's a good idea;
get your rest.

19
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,510
(Sheldon:)There are a lot more
rich old ladies out there,

20
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:43,110
(Sheldon:)and Daddy needs
a new linear accelerator.

21
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:50,550
(Sheldon:)And I thought he didn't learn anything
from his relationship with you.

22
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,790
(Mrs Latham:)Hey!

23
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:53,820
(Sheldon:)Another compliment!

24
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:55,160
(Sheldon:)Learn to recognize them.

25
00:01:02,090 --> 00:01:03,260
(Seibert:)Ah, there he is!

26
00:01:03,310 --> 00:01:04,810
(Seibert:)The man of the hour!

27
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:06,480
(Seibert:)He took one for the team!

28
00:01:09,710 --> 00:01:12,720
(Leonard:)I didn't do it
for the money!

29
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:16,250
(Seibert:)Keep telling yourself that--
it makes it easier.

30
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:18,620
(Seibert:)Trust me, I know.

31
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:22,090
(Raj:)Cool, buddy!
That's awesome!
Yeah!

32
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:24,030
How was she?

